<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32467" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκμηρύομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wind off like a ball of thread,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Gal.</u>
				135c
			</span></i> ; of an army, <i>make</i> it <i>defile out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δύναμιν ἐκ τῶν δυσχωριῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					132
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ στενῆς θυρίδος.. ἐκμηρυόμενος
					αὑτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Aem.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr., of the
			army, <i>defile,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				6.5.22
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς χαράδρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.53.5
				</span></i>
			 (but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς δυσχωρίας</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				51.2
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph.,
				<i>evolve itself, develop,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				65
			</span></i>, cf. eund. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				780.30
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
